OL,3,AKing leads two-minute silence at
OL,4,ARemembrance Sunday service as Burnham
OL,5,Alays wreath
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe King leads the nation in a
OL,8,Ftwo-minute silence at the Cenotaph in
OL,9,Fcentral London to mark Remembrance
OL,10,FSunday - watch live coverage above
OL,12,FHe also laid a wreath to remember those
OL,13,Fwho died - why the memorial is
OL,14,Fsignificant
OL,16,FSome 10,000 armed forces veterans will
OL,17,Fsoon take part in the Royal British
OL,18,FLegion's march-past through Whitehall,
OL,19,Falongside about 20 World War Two
OL,20,Fveterans
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
