OL,3,AKing leads two-minute silence at
OL,4,ARemembrance Sunday service as Burnham
OL,5,Alays wreath
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I think it will be a very emotional
OL,8,Fday," says 103-year-old Annie Duplock,
OL,9,Fwho was a Land Girl during WW2
OL,11,FMeanwhile, Andy Burnham is joined by
OL,12,Fformer PMs including Boris Johnson,
OL,13,FTony Blair and John Major
OL,15,FAway from the capital, services are
OL,16,Falso taking place in communities across
OL,17,Fthe UK, including in Edinburgh, Belfast
OL,18,Fand Cardiff
